      "description": "<h2 data-section-id=\"1wpwaqe\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1213\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">Hank Williams, Jr. – Live At Cobo Hall Detroit<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1262\">Original MGM Records stereo pressing (SE-4644).</p>\n<p data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1307\">Classic live country performance featuring:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1555\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1tmog3c\" data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1320\">\nJambalaya\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1aeussa\" data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1335\">\nDetroit City\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"l7r9hu\" data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1355\">\nGames People Play\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1v99a1b\" data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1381\">\nStanding in the Shadows\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"bc72da\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1408\">\nFoggy Mountain Breakdown\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"16n0jqz\" data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1424\">\nYou Win Again\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1frbkhz\" data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1450\">\nShe Thinks I Still Care\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"31oihc\" data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1485\">\nDarling, You Know I Wouldn't Lie\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1979v5n\" data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1515\">\nI'm So Lonesome I Could Cry\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1495x60\" data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1537\">\nYour Cheatin' Heart\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"m2dxsz\" data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1555\">\nI Saw the Light\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1560\">\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1uef3h1\" data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1575\">Condition</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1591\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1591\">Vinyl: VG+</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1723\">Record retains excellent gloss with only light sleeve scuffs and minor hairlines from normal handling. No deep scratches observed.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1738\"><strong data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1738\">Cover: G+</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1891\">Original jacket shows noticeable shelf wear, ring wear, rubbing, creasing, edge wear, and corner wear. Please review all photos for cosmetic condition.</p>",
